Job Description 职位描述
•	Oversee end to end administrative operations for the Asia-Australasia region (including the UAE, Kazakhstan and other markets) and the Hong Kong office. Roll out corporate administrative policies, streamline regional operating procedures, and establish standardized regional administration frameworks to ensure efficient and orderly daily operations across all branch offices;
•	统筹负责亚澳区(包括阿联酋、哈萨克斯坦等国家)及香港办公室整体行政工作，落实公司行政制度，优化区域流程规范，搭建标准化区域行政运营体系，保障各网点办公有序运转；
•	Manage regional space operations, facility management, administrative safety oversight, corporate real estate affairs and other day to day administrative work;
•	负责区域空间运营，设施管理以及行政安全及企业不动产等日常行政工作；
•	Support the overall coordination and management of in house administrative and outsourced teams;
•	协助统筹管理内部相关行政团队及外包团队；
•	Develop the annual regional administrative budget, execute cost control measures, track daily expenses, optimize the cost structure and meet annual cost management objectives;
•	负责年度区域行政预算编制、费用管控及成本优化，达成年度成本管理目标；
•	Deliver key annual administrative projects and strategic initiatives, track progress, resolve operational issues and ensure timely, high quality completion of key tasks;
•	推进年度重点行政项目及战略举措，跟踪进度并解决运营相关问题，确保重要项目准时并高质量落地； 
•	Serve as the key liaison among the Overseas Admin Team, CICCI regional leadership, and local jurisdiction CEOs;
•	承担对外对接桥梁角色，对接行政管理部境外组、中金国际大区主管及辖区各国CEO；
•	Undertake other administrative duties and ad hoc assignments from senior management. 
•	完成上级领导安排的其他工作。
